{"title": "Decrepit Store", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:322px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:StoreMain2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/StoreMain2.jpg/320px-StoreMain2.jpg?cbed7c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/StoreMain2.jpg/480px-StoreMain2.jpg?cbed7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/StoreMain2.jpg/640px-StoreMain2.jpg?cbed7c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:StoreMain2.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"Enlarge\"></a></div>The main entrance of the Decrepit Store.</div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Decrepit Store</b>, also referred to as Store, is a custom interior. It only spawns on Facto, a.k.a., the Crocs inspired Lethal Company experience, by default, which is a moon that must be downloaded separately from the rest of \"Wesley's Moons\". After \"Obscurity\" update came out, this interior was removed from \"Wesley's Interiors\". Now you can only download its <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://thunderstore.io/c/lethal-company/p/Magic_Wesley/Decrepit_Store/\">standalone version on ThunderStore</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Rooms\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Rooms\">&gt; Rooms</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Secured Area </b> - Rooms with many wooden crates stacked on top of each other that generate behind security doors. The majority of scrap is condensed to spawning in these rooms.</li>\n<li><b>Display Rooms</b> - Rooms with a white tiled floor and many display pedestals. Scrap can generate on these pedestals.</li>\n<li><b>Old Storage Area</b> - A large part of the interior will generate as a far more run-down area with a wooden tile, various stacked crates, boxes, and miscellaneous items, and more worn down mannequins. The apparatus room tends to generate in this area.</li>\n<li><b>Apparatus Room</b> - Similar to the storage areas, this is a room with several stacked wooden crates. Several mannequins are lined up in front of the boxes on either side and surrounding the apparatus.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Hazards\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Hazards\">&gt; Hazards</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Mannequins</b> - When the apparatus is pulled, one mannequin in the interior will activate and spawn one of three unique entities: Mannequin, Broken Mannequin, or Headless Mannequin. All three are a silent variant of the Coil-Head.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:StoreSecuredArea.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"One of the storage areas behind a security door.\"><img alt=\"One of the storage areas behind a security door.\" src=\"/images/thumb/StoreSecuredArea.jpg/116px-StoreSecuredArea.jpg?8d2de6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"116\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/StoreSecuredArea.jpg/175px-StoreSecuredArea.jpg?8d2de6 1.5x, /images/thumb/StoreSecuredArea.jpg/231px-StoreSecuredArea.jpg?8d2de6 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">One of the storage areas behind a security door.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:StoreDisplayRoom1.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"One of the display rooms.\"><img alt=\"One of the display rooms.\" src=\"/images/thumb/StoreDisplayRoom1.jpg/116px-StoreDisplayRoom1.jpg?9f7df9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"116\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/StoreDisplayRoom1.jpg/175px-StoreDisplayRoom1.jpg?9f7df9 1.5x, /images/thumb/StoreDisplayRoom1.jpg/231px-StoreDisplayRoom1.jpg?9f7df9 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">One of the display rooms.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:StoreDisplayRoom2.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Another display room.\"><img alt=\"Another display room.\" src=\"/images/thumb/StoreDisplayRoom2.jpg/116px-StoreDisplayRoom2.jpg?cb40e0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"116\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/StoreDisplayRoom2.jpg/175px-StoreDisplayRoom2.jpg?cb40e0 1.5x, /images/thumb/StoreDisplayRoom2.jpg/231px-StoreDisplayRoom2.jpg?cb40e0 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Another display room.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:StoreOldArea.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Part of the old storage area.\"><img alt=\"Part of the old storage area.\" src=\"/images/thumb/StoreOldArea.jpg/116px-StoreOldArea.jpg?c61766\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"116\" height=\"65\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/StoreOldArea.jpg/175px-StoreOldArea.jpg?c61766 1.5x, /images/thumb/StoreOldArea.jpg/231px-StoreOldArea.jpg?c61766 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Part of the old storage area.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:15p